  function rememberFirmwarePackage(input){var profile=String($(input).data('profile')||''),load=String($(input).data('load')||''),key=firmwarePackageKey(profile,load),selected=selectedFirmwarePackages();if($(input).is(':checked'))selected[key]={profile:profile,load_name:load};else delete selected[key];updatePackageSelectionUi();}
  function updatePackageSelectionUi(){var selected=selectedFirmwarePackages(),visible=$('.ucm-fw-package-option:visible'),visibleComplete=visible.find('.ucm-fw-replication-package:not(:disabled)').length,selectedVisible=visible.find('.ucm-fw-replication-package:checked').length;$('#ucm-fw-package-count').text(Object.keys(selected).length+' selected');$('#ucm-fw-package-visible-count').text(visibleComplete+' visible · '+selectedVisible+' selected');}
  function filterReplicationPackages(){var query=$.trim(String($('#ucm-fw-package-search').val()||'').toLowerCase());$('.ucm-fw-package-option').each(function(){var match=!query||String($(this).data('search')||'').indexOf(query)!==-1;$(this).toggle(match);});updatePackageSelectionUi();}
  function renderReplicationPackages(bundles){var body=$('#ucm-fw-replication-packages').empty(),choices={},selected=selectedFirmwarePackages();(bundles||[]).filter(function(bundle){return bundle.status==='complete';}).forEach(function(bundle){choices[firmwarePackageKey(bundle.profile,bundle.load_name)]={profile:String(bundle.profile),load_name:String(bundle.load_name),available:true};});Object.keys(selected).forEach(function(key){if(!choices[key])choices[key]=selected[key];});Object.keys(choices).sort().forEach(function(key){var packageChoice=choices[key],input=$('<input type="checkbox" class="ucm-fw-replication-package">').attr({'data-profile':packageChoice.profile,'data-load':packageChoice.load_name}).prop('checked',!!selected[key]),label=$('<label class="checkbox-inline">').append(input,' ', $('<code>').text(packageChoice.profile+' / '+packageChoice.load_name));if(!packageChoice.available){label.append(' ', $('<span class="label label-warning">').text('Unavailable on source inventory'));input.prop('disabled',true);}var option=$('<div class="ucm-fw-package-option">').attr('data-search',(packageChoice.profile+' '+packageChoice.load_name).toLowerCase()).css({padding:'4px 6px'}).append(label);body.append(option);});if(!body.children().length)body.append($('<p class="text-muted">').text('No complete source packages are available in the current inventory.'));filterReplicationPackages();}
  function renderBundles(bundles){var body=$('#ucm-fw-bundles').empty(),complete=0;bundles.forEach(function(bundle){if(bundle.status==='complete')complete++;var sync=bundle.status==='complete'?$('<button type="button" class="btn btn-xs btn-default ucm-fw-sync">').text('Sync package').data({profile:bundle.profile,load:bundle.load_name}):$('<span class="text-muted">').text('Complete packages only');body.append($('<tr>').toggleClass('danger',bundle.status==='incomplete').toggleClass('warning',bundle.status==='case_mismatch').append($('<td>').append(statusLabel(bundle.status)),$('<td>').append($('<strong>').text(bundle.profile),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text(compatible(bundle))),$('<td>').append($('<code>').text(bundle.load_name)),$('<td>').append(fileList(bundle)),$('<td>').append(problemList(bundle)),$('<td>').append(sync)));});if(!bundles.length)body.append($('<tr>').append($('<td colspan="6" class="text-muted">').text('No inventory matches this compatibility profile. Upload the extracted vendor files, then rescan.')));$('#ucm-fw-summary').text(bundles.length+' package(s) shown · '+complete+' complete and selectable');}
  function assetStatus(status){var cls={verified:'label-success',incomplete:'label-warning',invalid:'label-danger',stale:'label-default',discovered:'label-info'};return $('<span class="label">').addClass(cls[status]||'label-default').text(status||'unknown');}
  function renderAssets(assets){var body=$('#ucm-assets-list').empty(),counts={},origin={generated:'Generated by module',managed_write:'Written by module',operator_upload:'Operator upload',tftp_observation:'Observed on TFTP',discovered:'Observed on TFTP'};(assets||[]).forEach(function(asset){var status=String(asset.status||asset.validation_status||asset.state||'discovered'),manifest=asset.manifest||[],issues=asset.issues||[],usage=asset.usage||[],roles=manifest.map(function(file){return String(file.role||'file')+': '+String(file.relative_path||file.filename||'');}),uses=usage.map(function(use){return String(use.type||'use')+': '+String(use.label||use.id||'');}),provenance=String(asset.provenance||'discovered');counts[status]=(counts[status]||0)+1;body.append($('<tr>').toggleClass('text-muted',status==='stale').append($('<td>').append($('<code>').text('#'+String(asset.asset_id||asset.id||'?')),' ',assetStatus(status)),$('<td>').append($('<strong>').text(asset.kind||''),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text(asset.profile||'No compatibility profile')),$('<td>').append($('<code>').text(asset.filename||''),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text(roles.join(' · ')||'No manifest')),$('<td>').append($('<span>').text(asset.asset_version||'Version not parsed'),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text(origin[provenance]||provenance)),$('<td>').append($('<span>').text(uses.join(' · ')||'Unused'),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible text-warning">').text(issues.map(function(issue){return issue.message||issue.code;}).join(' · '))),$('<td>').append($('<code>').text(asset.content_sha256||''),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text('signature: '+String(asset.signature_status||'unverified')))));});if(!body.children().length)body.append($('<tr>').append($('<td colspan="6" class="text-muted">').text('No recognized managed assets have been observed on this site.')));$('#ucm-assets-summary').text(Object.keys(counts).sort().map(function(status){return counts[status]+' '+status;}).join(' · ')||'No catalog entries');}
  function refreshAssets(){var current=firmwareRead('assets');var body=$('#ucm-assets-list').html('<tr><td colspan="6">Loading unified catalog…</td></tr>');call({op:'managed_asset_inventory',state:'current',limit:500}).done(function(resp){if(!current())return;var r=result(resp);if(!r.ok){renderAssets([]);$('#ucm-assets-summary').text(r.message||'Cannot load managed assets');return;}renderAssets(r.catalog_assets||r.assets||[]);}).fail(function(){if(!current())return;body.html('<tr><td colspan="6" class="text-danger">Managed asset catalog request failed.</td></tr>');});}
  function timezoneFamilies(compatibility){return Object.keys(compatibility||{}).filter(function(key){var row=compatibility[key]||{};return row.status==='complete'||row.configuration_usable;}).map(function(key){return compatibility[key].label||key;});}
  function timezoneCandidatePayload(){return String($('#ucm-tz-candidate-profile option:selected').data('payload')||'');}
  function updateTimezoneCandidateHelp(){$('#ucm-tz-candidate-file-help').text('Upload '+timezoneCandidatePayload()+'. It becomes one independent retained revision; other runtimes are untouched.');}
  function renderTimezoneAssets(assets,profiles){var body=$('#ucm-tz-assets').empty(),count=0;profiles=profiles||{};Object.keys(profiles).forEach(function(profile){var definition=profiles[profile]||{},matching=(assets||[]).filter(function(asset){return String(asset.profile||'')===profile;});if(!matching.length){body.append($('<tr class="warning">').append($('<td>').append($('<strong>').text(definition.architecture||profile),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text((definition.models||[]).join(', '))),$('<td>').append($('<code>').text(definition.payload||'')),$('<td colspan="2" class="text-muted">').text('No retained revision. Upload this runtime payload or scan TFTP root.')));return;}matching.forEach(function(asset){count++;var status=asset.selectable?'complete':'incomplete';body.append($('<tr>').toggleClass('warning',!asset.selectable).append($('<td>').append($('<strong>').text(asset.architecture||definition.architecture||profile),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text((asset.models||definition.models||[]).join(', '))),$('<td>').append($('<code>').text(asset.payload||definition.payload||''),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text((asset.firmware_profiles||[]).join(', '))),$('<td>').append($('<strong>').text(asset.version||'content version'),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text(asset.canonical_active?'Also matches the current canonical root file':'Retained independently')),$('<td>').append(statusLabel(status),' ',$('<code>').text(String(asset.sha256||'').slice(0,16)+'…'),$('<small class="ucm-fw-compatible">').text(String(asset.asset_key||'').slice(0,16)+'…'))));});});if(!body.children().length)body.append($('<tr>').append($('<td colspan="4" class="text-muted">').text('No Cisco timezone runtime profiles are available.')));$('#ucm-tz-assets-summary').text(count+' retained selectable runtime revision(s) · up to three revisions are kept per architecture');}
  function renderTimezone(bundle){
    bundle=bundle||{};var body=$('#ucm-tz-files').empty(),compat=$('#ucm-tz-compat').empty(),issues=bundle.issues||[],status=String(bundle.status||'unknown');
    (bundle.files||[]).forEach(function(file){var fileStatus=!file.present?'incomplete':(file.readable===false?'incomplete':(file.exact_case===false?'case_mismatch':'complete'));body.append($('<tr>').toggleClass('danger',fileStatus==='incomplete').toggleClass('warning',fileStatus==='case_mismatch').append($('<td>').append($('<code>').text(file.actual_name||file.name)),$('<td>').text(file.role||''),$('<td>').append(statusLabel(fileStatus)),$('<td>').text(file.size==null?'—':Number(file.size).toLocaleString()+' bytes'),$('<td>').append($('<code>').text(file.sha256||''))));});
    if(!body.children().length)body.append($('<tr>').append($('<td colspan="5" class="text-muted">').text('No timezone inventory available.')));
    Object.keys(bundle.compatibility||{}).forEach(function(key){var row=bundle.compatibility[key]||{},state=String(row.status||'unknown'),decision=state==='complete'?'Version-consistent and selectable':(row.configuration_usable?'Present; emitted with an explicit version-inspection warning':(state==='legacy_frozen'?'Cisco-frozen legacy payload is older than advertised; not emitted for this family':(state==='mismatch'?'Blocked for this phone family until the payload matches tzupdater.ver':'Not emitted for this phone family'))),actual=row.actual_version||(state==='unverified'?'Not readable from this payload':'—');compat.append($('<tr>').toggleClass('danger',state==='mismatch'||state==='incomplete').toggleClass('warning',state==='unverified'||state==='legacy_frozen').append($('<td>').append($('<strong>').text(row.label||key),' ',statusLabel(state)),$('<td>').append($('<code>').text(row.payload||'')),$('<td>').text(row.advertised_iana_version||row.advertised_version||'—'),$('<td>').text(actual),$('<td>').text(decision)));});
    if(!compat.children().length)compat.append($('<tr>').append($('<td colspan="5" class="text-muted">').text('No phone-family compatibility results are available.')));
    var readyFamilies=Object.keys(bundle.compatibility||{}).filter(function(key){return !!(bundle.compatibility[key]||{}).configuration_usable;}).length;
    $('#ucm-tz-summary').empty().append(statusLabel(readyFamilies?'complete':status),' ',document.createTextNode(readyFamilies+' runtime payload profile(s) ready · recognized version stamp: '+String(bundle.served_version||(bundle.derived_version?'can generate '+bundle.derived_version:'not detected'))));
    $('#ucm-tz-issues').toggleClass('text-danger',status==='mixed'||status==='incomplete').text(issues.map(function(issue){return issue.message||issue.code;}).join(' · ')||(status==='complete'?'Every recognized canonical runtime payload is present and internally consistent.':''));
    $('#ucm-tz-capture').prop('disabled',!bundle.capture_allowed).attr('title',bundle.capture_allowed?'Retain the exact current files and their per-family compatibility evidence.':'Capture requires at least one usable family payload or one safely derivable version.');
